  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FFD Myanmar -Norway Cooperation in the Fisheries and Aquaculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support the long-term goal, in which fisheries and the aquaculture sector becomes a contributing factor in a sustainable socio-economic development in Myanmar. The project will contribute significantly for accelerating sustainable management of off-shore marine fisheries and development of marine aquaculture production in Myanmar, and capacity-building within Department of Fisheries.</narrative>
  </description>
